                                                                css_length_absolute_length_to_px(&bottom_length),
                                                                css_length_absolute_length_to_px(&left_length))
    return overflow_clip_edge

## Which absolute rect of a paintable box united_rect_for_continuation_chain combines (its `get_rect` callable).
enum PaintUnitedRect:
    border_box
    content
    padding_box
    margin_box

## The rect `which` of `paintable_box` (the lambdas passed to united_rect_for_continuation_chain).
func paint_united_rect_of(paintable_box: PaintPaintableBox*, which: PaintUnitedRect) -> gfx.CssPixelRect:
    match which:
        .border_box: return paint_paintable_box_absolute_border_box_rect(paintable_box)
        .content: return paint_paintable_box_absolute_rect(paintable_box)
        .padding_box: return paint_paintable_box_absolute_padding_box_rect(paintable_box)
        .margin_box:
